{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>ובכה</b> Three times in the Masorah: ובכה · ובעמך · כי בכה ארוץ גדוד · בכה חסיתי. Teaches that the frogs came upon them in great hosts, hosts, and 'I in You, YHWH, have taken refuge' — for although it is not explicit that the frogs were not upon Israel, the Holy One, blessed be He, in His righteousness delivered them."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:15.469666518Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}